{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/722210-ex-3-i-scaled-up-the-world-map","id":722210,"title":"[Ex 3] I scaled up the world map","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-24T01:05:22-07:00","id":722210,"title":"[Ex 3] I scaled up the world map","content":"I ran the original high definition map (2890x1870px) through<a href=\"http://waifu2x.udp.jp/\" target=\"_blank\"> Waifu2x</a>, so I now have a larger map (5780x3740px).<br /> I figured this might interest someone else, so here you go.<br /> <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/JD36YlI.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">5780x3740px map is here.</a><br /> Courtesy of The Wizard of Oz, <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/MlgV37u.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">here's one with a 500-mile grid, also in 5780x3740px.</a><br /> <br /> <br /> I also have a much larger map (11560x7480px) with some minor issues, but I can't find a place to upload a 128MB picture. If someonhas a solution, let me know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8825,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8825-nallenon","user":"Nallenon","date":". 10-24-2015, 11:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":21}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8825-nallenon","name":"Nallenon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8825_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T03:54:55-07:00","id":722522,"title":"","content":"Nicely done. Thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2163-venatius","name":"Venatius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2163_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Dat